268 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 107 0 R/T(Visit the Grande Mosque, founded in 670 AD, considered the oldest in the Maghreb. Its forest of Roman and Byzantine columns, ancient prayer hall and iconic ribbed dome inspire profound contemplation across fourteen centuries. Continue to the Barbier Mosque and marvel at the Aghlabide Basins \204 magnificent 9th-century hydraulic engineering. The afternoon unfolds through the medina's intricate alleys, past craftsmen weaving celebrated Kairouan carpets and merchants of hand-crafted brassware and sweet makroudh pastries.)/E(Visit the Grande Mosque, founded in 670 AD, considered the oldest in the Maghreb. Its forest of Roman and Byzantine columns, ancient prayer hall and iconic ribbed dome inspire profound contemplation across fourteen centuries. Continue to the Barbier Mosque and marvel at the Aghlabide Basins \204 magnificent 9th-century hydraulic engineering. The afternoon unfolds through the medina's intricate alleys, past craftsmen weaving celebrated Kairouan carpets and merchants of hand-crafted brassware and sweet makroudh pastries.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[5]>>
