816 0 obj
<</Title(As Tunisia fades into the distance, the memories linger \204 the golden light over Dougga at dusk, the vast silence of the Sahara, the call to prayer drifting across ancient medinas, and the sea, always the sea, shining through whitewashed walls.)/Dest[26 0 R/Fit]/Parent 703 0 R/Prev 758 0 R/Next 759 0 R>>
