840 0 obj
<</Title(A sweeping day of discovery begins at El Jem \204 whose Roman amphitheatre, rivalling the Colosseum in grandeur, rises from the Sahel plain in a display of imperial ambition that still astonishes. The adjacent museum holds magnificent mosaics from Roman Africa.)/Dest[23 0 R/Fit]/Parent 828 0 R/Next 854 0 R>>
endobj

841 0 obj
<</Title(Dinner and overnight in Hammamet.)/Dest[23 0 R/Fit]/Parent 828 0 R/Prev 854 0 R/First 855 0 R/Last 856 0 R/Count -2>>
endobj

842 0 obj
<</Title(The free afternoon belongs entirely to you \204 a gift of freedom on the Tunisian Riviera. Perhaps a moment of stillness beside the water, a stroll through the gardens of the International Cultural Centre, or simply the slow pleasure of mint tea on a sun-warmed terrace.)/Dest[24 0 R/Fit]/Parent 813 0 R/Prev 829 0 R/Next 830 0 R>>
endobj

