846 0 obj
<</Title(Lunch in Bizerte, where a luminous lagoon opens to the Mediterranean, before continuing through fragrant pine forests to Tabarka \204 a coastal jewel on Tunisia's northern shore, known for its Genoese citadel, coral diving and the relaxed, unhurried rhythm of the Tunisian north. A leisurely walk through town as the sun descends over the water.)/Dest[15 0 R/Fit]/Parent 827 0 R/Prev 836 0 R/Next 837 0 R>>
endobj

847 0 obj
<</Title(DAY 04  \267  TABARKA \211 KAIROUAN)/Dest[16 0 R/Fit]/Parent 837 0 R>>
endobj

848 0 obj
<</Title(A day of extraordinary Roman heritage. Begin at Bulla Regia \204 uniquely famous for its underground villas built to escape the summer heat, their floors adorned with superb mosaics that glow in the cool subterranean light.)/Dest[16 0 R/Fit]/Parent 838 0 R/Next 859 0 R>>
endobj

849 0 obj
<</Title(Dinner and overnight in Kairouan.)/Dest[16 0 R/Fit]/Parent 838 0 R/Prev 860 0 R/First 861 0 R/Last 861 0 R/Count -1>>
