endobj

852 0 obj
<</Title(A morning immersed in the legendary Ksours \204 multi-storey fortified granaries \(ghorfas\) built by Berber tribes as communal treasure houses. Each ksar tells a story of extraordinary ingenuity, communal resilience, and a profound bond with one of the planet's most demanding landscapes.)/Dest[22 0 R/Fit]/Parent 839 0 R/Next 868 0 R>>
endobj

853 0 obj
<</Title(Dinner and overnight in Sfax.)/Dest[22 0 R/Fit]/Parent 839 0 R/Prev 869 0 R>>
endobj

854 0 obj
<</Title(Continue to Monastir for the 8th-century Ribat fortress and the gleaming white-marble mausoleum of Habib Bourguiba. A walk through the vibrant, UNESCO-listed medina of Sousse \204 ancient Hadrumentum \204 before the final drive to Hammamet: the jewel of the Tunisian Riviera, where whitewashed walls glow gold above a luminous turquoise sea.)/Dest[23 0 R/Fit]/Parent 828 0 R/Prev 840 0 R/Next 841 0 R>>
endobj

