859 0 obj
<</Title(Continue to Dougga: arguably the best-preserved Roman city in all of North Africa. Its hilltop theatre, triumphal capitol and thermal baths remain awe-inspiring testaments to ancient civilisation \204 a UNESCO World Heritage Site of rare, theatrical beauty set against the open Tunisian hills.)/Dest[16 0 R/Fit]/Parent 838 0 R/Prev 848 0 R/Next 860 0 R>>
endobj

860 0 obj
<</Title(Afternoon journey to Kairouan, one of the holiest cities in Islam, where the spiritual atmosphere is felt from the moment you pass through the ancient gates.)/Dest[16 0 R/Fit]/Parent 838 0 R/Prev 859 0 R/Next 849 0 R>>
endobj

861 0 obj
<</Title(DAY 05  \267  KAIROUAN)/Dest[17 0 R/Fit]/Parent 849 0 R>>
endobj

862 0 obj
<</Title(An entire day devoted to exploring one of the most revered cities in the Islamic world \204 the fourth holiest site after Mecca, Medina and Jerusalem.)/Dest[17 0 R/Fit]/Parent 850 0 R/Next 872 0 R>>
endobj

